0 FILE 40290 - Castle - Main model.ldr
0 A castle build on a black plate foundation with tan, green, and yellow sections, featuring a red flag, reddish-brown roof tiles, yellow walls, inverted slopes, door rails, and four corner towers with hinged walls and two door submodels.
0 Name: 40290 - Castle - Main model.ldr
0 Author: Willy Tschager [Holly-Wood]
